Vnum            9504
Name            冷光裂潭~
Description
裂壁在這裡內凹成一座半封閉石潭，潭中沒有水，只有一層像液體般緩慢起伏的淡色冷光。站得越久，越難分辨那光是在潭底流動，還是正從更深處往上滲出。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       WEST
ExitVnum        9503
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       EAST
ExitVnum        9510
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         冷光~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         裂谷~
End

End
